the indictment.

00:10:08.334 --> 00:10:10.901
-This fake case was brought
only to interfere

00:10:10.901 --> 00:10:14.200
with the upcoming 2024 election,

00:10:14.200 --> 00:10:16.801
and it should be
dropped immediately.

00:10:16.801 --> 00:10:18.434
-Say whatever you want
about the charges,

00:10:18.434 --> 00:10:20.133
but it's not a fake case,
