in Kentucky

00:10:51.901 --> 00:10:54.367
and one from a county attorney
in Tennessee.

00:10:54.367 --> 00:10:56.367
They -- they were Republican,
obviously.

00:10:56.367 --> 00:10:58.467
Both states
are heavily Republican.

00:10:58.467 --> 00:10:59.968
They want to know
if there are ways

00:10:59.968 --> 00:11:01.968
