by all means, arrest him.

00:11:23.601 --> 00:11:26.133
If you can catch him.

00:11:26.133 --> 00:11:29.334
Oh, those Biden boys!

00:11:29.334 --> 00:11:31.767
We're gonna catch them
Biden boys.

00:11:31.767 --> 00:11:33.400
[ Muttering ]

00:11:33.400 --> 00:11:35.667
[ Laughter ]

00:11:35.667 --> 00:11:37.634
Also these guys are --
they're just such morons.

00:11:37.634 --> 00:11:39.567
You went on TV and confessed
that Republicans

00:11:39.567 --> 00:11:42.033
are looking for ways to
manipulate the justice system

00:11:42.033 --> 00:11:44.801
to go after Biden
as political revenge.

00:11:44.801 --> 00:11:46.601
If those prosecutors
in Kentucky and Tennessee

00:11:46.601 --> 00:11:47.801
