00:11:49.734 --> 00:11:51.567
and the judge will say
the court rule is that you are,

00:11:51.567 --> 00:11:53.868
and this is the legal term,
a massive [bleep].

00:11:53.868 --> 00:11:57.033
Whatever, whatever else
you may think of this case,

00:11:57.033 --> 00:11:58.267
the image of Trump
in that courthouse

00:11:58.267 --> 00:12:00.334
sent a message
a former president

00:12:00.334 --> 00:12:02.067
had to face the criminal
justice system

00:12:02.067 --> 00:12:05.100
the same way anyone else would
under the same circumstances.

00:12:05.100 --> 00:12:07.434
Trump may be pretending
he's enjoying all of this,

00:12:07.434 --> 00:12:09.634
but I assure you, when he was
in that courthouse hearing

00:12:09.634 --> 00:12:11.367
the charges read out loud,
his stomach...

00:12:11.367 --> 00:12:13.067
-Dropped immediately.

00:12:13.067 --> 00:12:14.701
